00:00:01.402 --> 00:00:02.624
1000AwesomeThings.com

00:00:02.624 --> 00:00:04.344
I will never do it for money.

00:00:04.344 --> 00:00:06.553
I never put an ad on the website ever.

00:00:06.553 --> 00:00:08.856
50 million hits it's only cost me money

00:00:08.856 --> 00:00:10.390
