00:00:35.026 --> 00:00:35.859
My new book is called

00:00:35.859 --> 00:00:37.473
The Happiness Equation.

00:00:37.473 --> 00:00:38.810
It shares the nine simple secrets

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:39.958
we can all do everyday

00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:41.629
to live happier lives.

00:00:41.629 --> 00:00:42.773
I'm Neil Pasricha.

00:00:42.773 --> 00:00:43.747
I'm here with Evan Carmichael.

00:00:43.747 --> 00:00:46.830
Here are my top 10 rules for success.

